OL,3,GNEWSAPolice hail new interim driving
OL,4,Abans for suspects
OL,5,
OL,6,FSuspected drug-drivers in Essex are
OL,7,Fbeing given temporary driving bans to
OL,8,Fprevent them from re-offending while
OL,9,Funder investigation, a senior police
OL,10,Fofficer has said.
OL,12,FImposed as a bail condition for up to
OL,13,Fsix weeks, the restriction forbids
OL,14,Fsuspects from getting behind the wheel
OL,15,Fwhile police continue their inquiries.
OL,17,FAdam Pipe, head of the county's roads
OL,18,Fpolicing unit, branded the ban
OL,19,F"groundbreaking".
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
